Shade wrote:
> I wasn't aware that the artifacts could change alignment (or be
> generated with different alignments)

The general rule is, your own guaranteed first sacrifice gift (if any) 
and your own quest artifact will be adjusted in alignment to your 
*initial* alignment - that is, the alignment you started the game with 
(for those interested see hack_artifacts() in artifact.c).

Thus provided you have not converted, these objects should always be 
safe to use.

Note that this means Mjollnir will never be generated chaotic, at least 
in vanilla (contrary to what Jym said).

